{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017CN3rgxN8SXLYJvHwBtwve","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-16-1430-column-batched-ntt-for-rs-code-matrix\n2\t\n3\tImprove the NTT memory access efficiency in `rs_code_matrix` by processing columns in L2-cache-sized batches instead of all columns simultaneously. The current `batch_ntt` processes all ~53K columns (at APC 300) in a single call, creating a 3.4GB working set that far exceeds the RTX 4090's 72MB L2 cache. This forces every NTT butterfly stage to read from DRAM at large strides, achieving only ~30% of peak bandwidth. By splitting the NTT into batches of ~1000 columns (~64MB per batch, fitting in L2), the second NTT stage reads data that's still L2-resident from the first stage, potentially doubling effective bandwidth. This improvement disproportionately helps APC 300 (short columns, 64KB each, excellent L2 reuse) over APC 0 (tall columns, 4MB each, less L2 benefit).\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"97849a12-7ea3-4743-9ec4-4f09ecc25100","uuid":"e9a4aacf-3313-452e-9cb8-8059363a3c98","timestamp":"2026-04-16T13:39:26.767Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-16-1430-column-batched-ntt-for-rs-code-matrix\n\nImprove the NTT memory access efficiency in `rs_code_matrix` by processing columns in L2-cache-sized batches instead of all columns simultaneously. The current `batch_ntt` processes all ~53K columns (at APC 300) in a single call, creating a 3.4GB working set that far exceeds the RTX 4090's 72MB L2 cache. This forces every NTT butterfly stage to read from DRAM at large strides, achieving only ~30% of peak bandwidth. By splitting the NTT into batches of ~1000 columns (~64MB per batch, fitting in L2), the second NTT stage reads data that's still L2-resident from the first stage, potentially doubling effective bandwidth. This improvement disproportionately helps APC 300 (short columns, 64KB each, excellent L2 reuse) over APC 0 (tall columns, 4MB each, less L2 benefit).\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
